 one<br /> <br /> 4) Severing all contact takes them off the board of the Jyhad, which is more dangerous than being a random human.<br /> <br /> 5) Ghouldom is separate from Touchstones, you aren't forced to take ghouls, you are forced to take touchstones, their is no way in core to not have them (and not having them makes you degenerate faster)</div> </div> </div> </div>1:] and 2:] Touchstones get attacked for cheap drama but Mary Jane or Aunt May would be dead at the hands of supervillains if Spider-Man wasn't there. The same with Touchstones.<br /> <br /> The big thing isn't that being beloved by a vampire puts them in danger [it CAN] but that a vampire CARES about them being in danger.<br /> <br /> 4:] If they're not part of the Jyhad, they're just food.<br /> <br /> 5:] Your ghoul CAN be your Touchstone, though, which means you can give them immortality and superpowers as well as have a desire to protect them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\