em in danger [it CAN] but that a vampire CARES about them being in danger.<br /> <br /> 4:] If they're not part of the Jyhad, they're just food.<br /> <br /> 5:] Your ghoul CAN be your Touchstone, though, which means you can give them immortality and superpowers as well as have a desire to protect them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1) and 2) Don't know enough Spiderman to really comment on that directly, but, being a target because they are a touchstone isn't being saved, it's being endangered in the first place, which if the care was genuine, would be avoided by ghosting them. <br /> <br /> 4)yes, but with the same greatly reduced chance of being targeted and killed as the average human. <br /> <br /> 5)Which makes it worse, not only are they your 'link to humanity' (because apparently personal morality no longer matters at all, you have to subcontract it) they are also your Renfield (Which can be fun, don't get me wrong, but..well..) how, exactly is this LESS abusive than the previous 'putting people in extreme danger, which they cannot consent to in an informed manner without getting you both killed as a masquerade breach?' (And that extreme danger being the LEAST TERRIBLE version of touchstones0","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-01T15:46:19-07:00","id":1393536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/m