t two clanbooks,<br /> if you played antitribu...good luck, even their camarilla clanbook equivalent didn't have much info on them,<br /> you had to read the lasombra and tzimisce books,<br /> decide if you wanted your antitribu to be more like lasombra or more like tzimisce,<br /> read chaining the beast to choose a path,<br /> realize it's not enough and either check out the Dark Ages Road Books or the Dharma books to get more info,<br /> only then were you good to go</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> and all we are shown this edition is the Sabbat getting a kicking, loosing territory, loosing clans, loosing paths, loosing to the beast, lose after lose after lose, we are told they are winning, told to buy yet another book for a half page mention, but all we see is defeat after defeat and core ideas being cast aside, ignored or retconed. <br /> <br /> EDIT: removed some comments that were to harsh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 06-02-2020, 06:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T03:12:46-07:00","id":1393603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393602#post1393602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and all we are shown this edition is the Sabbat getting a kicking, loosing territory, loosing clans, loosing paths, loosing to the beast, lose after lose after lose, we are told they are winning, told to buy yet another book for a half page mention, but all we see is defeat after defeat and core ideas being cast aside, ignored or retconed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel I've come to terms with the fact that neither the devs nor the community seem interested in the sabbat,<br /> and that people like me will only make it worse by encouraging the devs to care even less about the sabbat<br /> <br /> V5 was my last hope...<br /> <br /> now, I should just be grateful for revised and the backers that brought us &quot;some&quot; sabbat love in v20 and shut my mouth for good","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":10998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","user":"Pleiades","date":". 06-02-2020, 06:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T07:29:17-07:00","id":1393623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393576#post1393576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--bl