p;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T07:56:12-07:00","id":1393634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393629#post1393629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Taggie, you remember that the Edition Wars are over, right? You can offer criticism of V5's handling of things but bashing is not allowed.<br /> <br /> I appreciate you removing your harsher comments in the previous post. You get a gold star for that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This Edition may roll an authors saving throw with an awesome Sabbat book, but I don't see any evidence of that so far, they seem to have decided the Anarchs take the Sabbats role, so the Sabbat aren't needed, or at least not needed in to role they used to fulfil, we still have no idea, apart form dispersed hints, as to what they actually will be, and with no sign of any book on the horizon, nor any idea who will be writing it, I don't have much hope.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T08:02:15-07:00","id":1393636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393634#post1393634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This Edition may roll an authors saving throw with an awesome Sabbat book, but I don't see any evidence of that so far, they seem to have decided the Anarchs take the Sabbats role, so the Sabbat aren't needed, or at least not needed in to role they used to fulfil, we still have no idea, apart form dispersed hints, as to what they actually will be, and with no sign of any book on the horizon, nor any idea who will be writing it, I don't have much hope.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jason Carl has said that there's currently no plans for doing a Sabbat book so you are 100% right that it is not something that they are doing yet. I don't think it's the case of &quot;The Anarchs take the Sabbat's role&quot; though because the Sabbat had many roles and elements of them have shown up everywhere but with no one embodying what the Sabbat was. I do hope that we do get more information on them but it seems like it will be a long wait, which is a shame.<br /> <br /> My opinion as a fan is that the Sabbat should have had a book at the very beginning of the game. The Sabbat are hugely popular and this is essentially like doing Dungeons and Dragons without including Thieves.<br /> <br /> So I get the frustration and that's why I've tried to do house rules and suggestions for doing material for Sabbat games and players. It sucks to have your favorite splat not supported and hopefully the Tzimisce write-ups will give information on how to at least run ones own games of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T08:07:38-07:00","id":1393638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393636#post1393636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Jason Carl has said that there's currently no plans for doing a Sabbat book so you are 100% right that it is not something that they are doing yet. I don't think it's the case of &quot;The Anarchs take the Sabbat's role&quot; though because the Sabbat had many roles and elements of them have shown up everywhere but with no one embodying what the Sabbat was. I do hope that we do get more information on them but it seems like it will be a long wait, which is a shame.<br /> <br /> My opinion as a fan is that the Sabbat should have had a book at the very beginning of the game. The Sabbat are hugely popular and this is essentially like doing Dungeons and Dragons without including Thieves.<br /> <br /> So I get the frustration and that's why I've tried to do house rules and suggestions for doing material for Sabbat games and players. It sucks to have your favorite splat not supported and hopefully the Tzimisce write-ups will give information on how to at least run ones own games of them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe, maybe they can publish something that makes the gehenna crusade and mass defections make sense, but so far it really does feel like they are gutting the Sabbat and holding up anarchs and cults as replacements that we should be content with, and with the Lasombra as precedent, I expect the Tzim to miss what I liked about them as well, and it to be yet another group of defectors on the new touchstone system, to allow them into anarch and cam games, so...yea not interested, and honestly have neither the cash nor inclination to keep buying books, for the maybe couple of pages and some hints that tell me about the sect I actually care about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T08:17:31-07:00","id":1393641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393638#post1393638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Maybe, maybe they can publish something that makes the gehenna crusade and mass defections make sense, but so far it really does feel like they are gutting the Sabbat and holding up anarchs and cults as replacements that we should be content with, and with the Lasombra as precedent, I expect the Tzim to miss what I liked about them as well, and it to be yet another group of defectors on the new touchstone system, to allow them into anarch and cam games, so...yea not interested, and honestly have neither the cash nor inclination to keep buying books, for the maybe couple of pages and some hints that tell me about the sect I actually care about.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is your right to only enjoy previous editions and not support new content until it provides what you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T18:25:30-07:00","id":1393719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393638#post1393638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Maybe, maybe they can publish something that makes the gehenna crusade and mass defections make sense, but so far it really does feel like they are gutting the Sabbat and holding up anarchs and cults as replacements that we should be content with, and with the Lasombra as precedent, I expect the Tzim to miss what I liked about them as well, and it to be yet another group of defectors on the new touchstone system, to allow them into anarch and cam games, so...yea not interested, and honestly have neither the cash nor inclination to keep buying books, for the maybe couple of pages and some hints that tell me about the sect I actually care about.</div> </div> </div> </div>Their probably not going to conspicuously do anything with the Tzimisce for a long time because then that would mean that'd actually have to do SOMETHING concrete with the Sabbat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T18:34:23-07:00","id":1393722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393719#post1393719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Their probably not going to conspicuously do anything with the Tzimisce for a long time because then that would mean that'd actually have to do SOMETHING concrete with the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I'm 99% sure they'll be in the Players Guide. They will probably include rules for Camarilla and Anarch Tzimisce, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-02T23:30:18-07:00","id":1393747,"title":"","content":"My (not that great) V5 Sabbat Justification. <br /> <br /> Some of you might be familiar with my V5 Camarilla ideas: The Camarilla is to become an awesome happy place by becoming a super-supportive economic elite, removing the people they don't want to support, and also they want to watch the anarchs tear eachother apart with the preasure of the SI on them so they can begin again and form a new monopoly. <br /> <br /> So the Sabbat play into that. <br /> The Sabbat elders want to join the nuCamarilla; they don't care about the sect, they've always been out for themselves. In return for handing over new cities and giving the sect some powerful elders, some concessions were made: The Camarilla was to allow for open Nodism and other faiths, and the Tremere HQ would be destroyed (which the Tremere caught wind of and did themselves because they're Savvy like that) <br /> <br /> So the neonates who actually buy the Sabbat's BS were sent off to fight in the middle east, whilst the majority of elders brought their fortunes into the cam. (ancillae, in the Sabbat, are few and could've gone either way). A large number of Lasombra, being the magnificent bastards they are, suspected this so made a more open bid to get into the Cam. <br /> <br /> When the Sabbat comes back, there'll be hell to pay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:06:02-07:00","id":1393789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393719#post1393719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Their probably not going to conspicuously do anything with the Tzimisce for a long time because then that would mean that'd actually have to do SOMETHING concrete with the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nah. The devs have said in a couple of places that part of V5 is removing the 'sect locks' from various clans, and we've already seen examples of Tzimisce in things like the Prince of Tokyo in the Camarilla book. 'Too Sabbat' was mentioned when the Player's Guide was initially delayed, because whatever Modiphius wrote for the Tzimisce wasn't to WW's liking in that department.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1808,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","user":"elmerg","date":". 06-03-2020, 01:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:24:04-07:00","id":1393792,"title":"","content":"But the Cam hate the Tzmisce... Vicissitude is aliens don't you know? <br /> If they wanted to avoid sect locks then the Hecata.... <br /> <br /> I think the sect locks are what drive interesting characters. The rare Lasombra Antitribu who must do their best to work within a sect that resists them whilst both being hungry for power and needing to keep a low profile in case the rest of the clan decide they want you eaten. The secret Tzmisce of the Camarilla who's clan is vilified and her practices are shunned. The lone necromancer who wants to work in another sect but doesn't really have other clan members present to act as his union. <br /> <br /> Vampire is set up for fear and loathing, fear of the other, enemies are everywhere, don't trust what you don't understand, It's you against your brother, you and your brother against your cousin, everyone prior against god and the world. The world of darkness is one made up of barriers. The more connected people are, the more access they have to information, the less darkness there is. No sect barriers would provide us with an illuminated age for vampires; The setting just wouldn't work with such generosity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:30:31-07:00","id":1393794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393789#post1393789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah. The devs have said in a couple of places that part of V5 is removing the 'sect locks' from various clans, and we've already seen examples of Tzimisce in things like the Prince of Tokyo in the Camarilla book. 'Too Sabbat' was mentioned when the Player's Guide was initially delayed, because whatever Modiphius wrote for the Tzimisce wasn't to WW's liking in that department.</div> </div> </div> </div>They also rewrote the Church of Caine section for Cult of the Blood Gods.<br /> <br /> Basically, the note they sent reading, &quot;This isn't supposed to be the Sabbat 2.0.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which is how the Cainite Heresy got revived in 2020.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393792#post1393792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But the Cam hate the Tzmisce... Vicissitude is aliens don't you know?<br /> If they wanted to avoid sect locks then the Hecata....<br /> <br /> I think the sect locks are what drive interesting characters. The rare Lasombra Antitribu who must do their best to work within a sect that resists them whilst both being hungry for power and needing to keep a low profile in case the rest of the clan decide they want you eaten. The secret Tzmisce of the Camarilla who's clan is vilified and her practices are shunned. The lone necromancer who wants to work in another sect but doesn't really have other clan members present to act as his union.<br /> <br /> Vampire is set up for fear and loathing, fear of the other, enemies are everywhere, don't trust what you don't understand, It's you against your brother, you and your brother against your cousin, everyone prior against god and the world. The world of darkness is one made up of barriers. The more connected people are, the more access they have to information, the less darkness there is. No sect barriers would provide us with an illuminated age for vampires; The setting just wouldn't work with such generosity.</div> </div> </div> </div>At the end of the day, it should be what works best for maximum player enjoyment.<br /> <br /> I was always disappointed in that I wanted to play Noddist characters and Caine worshipers but had to deal with, &quot;Oh, so you're Sabbat.&quot; &quot;No, the Sabbat are doing it wrong.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:32:21-07:00","id":1393795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393789#post1393789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'Too Sabbat' was mentioned when the Player's Guide was initially delayed, because whatever Modiphius wrote for the Tzimisce wasn't to WW's liking in that department.</div> </div> </div> </div>#ReleaseTheModiphiusCut <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:35:16-07:00","id":1393799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393795#post1393795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> #ReleaseTheModiphiusCut<br /> <br /> (joke btw)</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine it went like this:<br /> <br /> <i>Paradox: Okay, Todd, we're looking forward to your Tzimisce revival. We want to appeal to a wider branch of gamers and avoid sectlock. Our new grittier and street level game is something that we hope will avoid some of the silliness of before.<br /> <br /> Todd: FLESH CATHEDRALS, MONSTER CREATURES, BLOOD FOR THE ELDEST<br /> <br /> Paradox: Todd....we were thinking more like classical Dracula. You know, Lords in creepy castles. More Strahd and less Ed Gein.<br /> <br /> Todd: I wear the living skull of my enemies!</i><br /> <br /> No, it probably didn't go that way but I choose to imagine it did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T10:43:24-07:00","id":1393801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393799#post1393799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Todd: FLESH CATHEDRALS, MONSTER CREATURES, BLOOD FOR THE ELDEST<br /> <br /> Paradox: Todd....we were thinking more like classical Dracula. You know, Lords in creepy castles. More Strahd and less Ed Gein.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, that shouldn't be much of a worry, since there are at least 3 or 4 clans filling that role rn without needing the Tzimisce's help,<br /> and since vicissitude is becoming protean,<br /> I think most players won't have trouble making fancy creepy Gangrel/Ministry lords in their castle<br /> <br /> (mind you, I'm not against the idea of V5 standardized tzimisce getting a write up, and I'm not even sure why I wrote what I just did...moving on)<br /> <br /> <br /> this is none of my concern, I was more shaken by the &quot;Too Sabbat&quot; thing, and I'm stuck rn trying to figure out how something can be &quot;too Sabbat&quot; in V5<br /> <br /> (again, I probably know the answer to this question but...man I'm bored)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T11:11:43-07:00","id":1393803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393801#post1393801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> well, that shouldn't be much of a worry, since there are at least 3 or 4 clans filling that role rn without needing the Tzimisce's help,<br /> and since vicissitude is becoming protean,<br /> I think most players won't have trouble making fancy creepy Gangrel/Ministry lords in their castle<br /> <br /> (mind you, I'm not against the idea of V5 standardized tzimisce getting a write up, and I'm not even sure why I wrote what I just did...moving on)<br /> <br /> <br /> this is none of my concern, I was more shaken by the &quot;Too Sabbat&quot; thing, and I'm stuck rn trying to figure out how something can be &quot;too Sabbat&quot; in V5<br /> <br /> (again, I probably know the answer to this question but...man I'm bored)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hopeful answer to the too Sabbat thing: They want to do the Sabbat cleanly and in one book. Not hopeful answer...you know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T11:23:09-07:00","id":1393805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393803#post1393803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hopeful answer to the too Sabbat thing: They want to do the Sabbat cleanly and in one book. Not hopeful answer...you know.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, at least we now know that Modiphius are into the Sabbat,<br /> which might be good news,<br /> <br /> but I'd rather not keep my hopes up, I'm burnt out on wishful thinking :/<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T11:35:00-07:00","id":1393807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393801#post1393801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> well, that shouldn't be much of a worry, since there are at least 3 or 4 clans filling that role rn without needing the Tzimisce's help,</div> </div> </div> </div>Serious question but are there people who actually think Vicissitude is the most important part of the Tzimisce? For me, it's always been a superficial read of the clan. For me, what makes the Tzimisce awesome is their Old Eastern European sensibility. They're a bunch of ancient lords and ladies who haven't lost their way like the Ventrue have. They have castles, follow guest rite, and are very much creatures of their word. They are the REAL Dracula clan.<br /> <br /> Vicissitude is just so...distracting from the cool roleplaying elements of them. I mean, who gives a shit if they can flesh sculpt? What does that have to do with what they're REALLY about?<br /> <br /> Koludnism, connection with the Earth (its their Clan weakness), ancient blood ties between each other, Ghoul Families, and cheesy Eastern European accents.<br /> <br /> I mean, Vicissitude is cool and all but it's like loving the Ravnos for Chimestry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T11:44:11-07:00","id":1393810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393807#post1393807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Serious question but are there people who actually think Vicissitude is the most important part of the Tzimisce? For me, it's always been a superficial read of the clan. For me, what makes the Tzimisce awesome is their Old Eastern European sensibility. They're a bunch of ancient lords and ladies who haven't lost their way like the Ventrue have. They have castles, follow guest rite, and are very much creatures of their word. They are the REAL Dracula clan.<br /> <br /> Vicissitude is just so...distracting from the cool roleplaying elements of them. I mean, who gives a shit if they can flesh sculpt? What does that have to do with what they're REALLY about?<br /> <br /> Koludnism, connection with the Earth (its their Clan weakness), ancient blood ties between each other, Ghoul Families, and cheesy Eastern European accents.<br /> <br /> I mean, Vicissitude is cool and all but it's like loving the Ravnos for Chimestry.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> for me it's (not always, but usually) the monstrous transhumanism of Metamorphosis, combined with the hideous experiments and weird 'science', or the even weirder studies of Death and the Soul . That's what I am looking for in Tzim in modern WoD. In DA I go for the territorial noble monster, but not looking for that in a modern setting. It's like loving the Ventrue for sharp suits, big bank accounts and Dominate, or Brujah for rebellion, Presence, and anger management issues. Take away Viscittude, and I would stop caring about them they would just be weird ventrue, and we already have that. So for me it;s the exact opposite, I don't give a shit about old castles and Dracula, I want to explore the limits of mutation, alteration, and mutilation. with crazy pseudo science and insane disciplines","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 06-03-2020, 03:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T11:51:02-07:00","id":1393811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393807#post1393807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Serious question but are there people who actually think Vicissitude is the most important part of the Tzimisce? For me, it's always been a superficial read of the clan. For me, what makes the Tzimisce awesome is their Old Eastern European sensibility. They're a bunch of ancient lords and ladies who haven't lost their way like the Ventrue have. They have castles, follow guest rite, and are very much creatures of their word. They are the REAL Dracula clan.<br /> <br /> Vicissitude is just so...distracting from the cool roleplaying elements of them. I mean, who gives a shit if they can flesh sculpt? What does that have to do with what they're REALLY about?<br /> <br /> Koludnism, connection with the Earth (its their Clan weakness), ancient blood ties between each other, Ghoul Families, and cheesy Eastern European accents.<br /> <br /> I mean, Vicissitude is cool and all but it's like loving the Ravnos for Chimestry.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I always felt Tzimisce were a mix between Ventrue and Gangrel<br /> <br /> you could pick Dracula, Ruthven or whatever, make them into either gangrel or ventrue and it would still work<br /> <br /> you can't do the same with Vykos or Jolan however,<br /> and what makes those two different?<br /> vicissitude and koldunism<br /> <br /> I'm not saying the Tzimisce are all about Vicissitude,<br /> but remove vicissitude and there's suddenly little that differentiates them from other clans (I know, their history is still important, so is their role in the sabbat...but I don't think V5 cares much about that)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T12:03:14-07:00","id":1393814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393810#post1393810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">for me it's (not always, but usually) the monstrous transhumanism of Metamorphosis, combined with the hideous experiments and weird 'science', or the even weirder studies of Death and the Soul . That's what I am looking for in Tzim in modern WoD. In DA I go for the territorial noble monster, but not looking for that in a modern setting. It's like loving the Ventrue for sharp suits, big bank accounts and Dominate, or Brujah for rebellion, Presence, and anger management issues. Take away Viscittude, and I would stop caring about them they would just be weird ventrue, and we already have that. So for me it;s the exact opposite, I don't give a shit about old castles and Dracula, I want to explore the limits of mutation, alteration, and mutilation. with crazy pseudo science and insane disciplines</div> </div> </div> </div>I always felt the Tremere should have more of that. I'm hoping we get a human experimentation and torture House, which <b><i>Night Road</i></b> will be including.<br /> <br /> If they make Vicissitude a Combo Discipline would allow more opportunities for other mad science too.<br /> <br /> Banu Haqim Mad Science!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T12:14:04-07:00","id":1393816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1393814#post1393814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I always felt the Tremere should have more of that. I'm hoping we get a human experimentation and torture House, which <b><i>Night Road</i></b> will be including.<br /> <br /> If they make Vicissitude a Combo Discipline would allow more opportunities for other mad science too.<br /> <br /> Banu Haqim Mad Science!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No thanks. Do not want. At all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","dat