ss/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1394262#post1394262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Granular? Eh. Sure but. To each their own. Not hard enough? You can literally take a level 6 sin as the equivalent of a level 1 sin in the old editions. And the higher levels were supposed to be more restrictive. But. At this point I could list off the entire path as convictions and you'd probably disagree with it simply because it's not a 1-1 conversion which. At this point, we know has 0 chance of happening. It's been hinted at, via the Gentleman Gamer's old videos, that the most that'll happen is that touchstones replace convictions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because you can't take all of those convictions at once, and they come with the millstone of Touchstones, the STs beatstick, by RAW a weapon against the players","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T00:02:12-07:00","id":1394268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1394263#post1394263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div>