ire gameline focusing on hamfisting Abrahamic style Demons into oWoD would canonize Caine?</div> </div> </div> </div>Only two words: &quot;Narrator&quot; and &quot;story&quot;. Narrators lie. I know, I have a degree in Literary Theory. Narrators lie. That Narrator says &quot;Caine&quot;; he could have said, as well, &quot;Enkidu&quot; or any other name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No, no, don't look any further, my profile is actually more handsome than me&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","name":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T00:31:35-07:00","id":1394272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alqamar Alaswad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1392809-v5-did-the-lasombra-right-and-wrong?p=1394270#post1394270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Only two words: &quot;Narrator&quot; and &quot;story&quot;. Narrators lie. I know, I have a degree in Literary Theory. Narrators lie. That Narrator says &quot;Caine&quot;; he could have said, as well, &quot;Enkidu&quot; or any other name.</div> </div> </div> </div>Furthermore, the Devil in question is giving his memories of the event and those are influenced by being shoved into the body of a Evangelist Minister's son. Every